1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:03,400
全世界咖啡店最多的城市，在中国
The city with the most cafés on Earth is in China

2
00:00:03,400 --> 00:00:07,000
上海，一万多家，比纽约伦敦加起来还多
Shanghai: 10,000+ — more than NYC and London combined

3
00:00:07,000 --> 00:00:10,600
而这条永康路，是它的心脏
And this lane — Yongkang Road — is its heart

4
00:00:10,600 --> 00:00:14,200
梧桐树下，一步一家咖啡馆
Under the plane trees, a café every few steps

5
00:00:14,200 --> 00:00:17,800
拉花在杯口打转，窗边坐满了人
Latte art swirls; every window seat is taken

6
00:00:17,800 --> 00:00:21,400
老洋房、小马路，慢慢喝一下午
Old villas, narrow streets — a whole slow afternoon

7
00:00:21,400 --> 00:00:25,000
侬好，今朝也来一杯伐？
"Nong ho" — Shanghainese for hi. One today too?

8
00:00:25,000 --> 00:00:28,000
关注，带你去下一座城
Follow — I'll take you to the next city
